### Submit a transaction through the gateway (amount in paise: 500 is rupees 5.00)
POST http://localhost:8000/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "account_id": "acc-1", "amount_cents": 500, "kind": "credit" }

### Read the account view (backend-for-frontend) through the gateway
GET http://localhost:8000/bff/account/acc-1
